%but it is also an exponentially small subset of \(\FF_{p^2}\)
%(the set of \emph{all} \(j\)-invariants),
%in the sense that a uniformly random element of \(\FF_{p^2}\)
%is in \(\SSset{1}\) with probability only \(\sim 12/p\).

Now fix a prime \(\ell \not= p\),
and consider the directed multigraph
