The gate process is healthy and all 12 sampling workers are active. This host is also running several unrelated builder jobs, so the wall-clock is longer than the isolated estimate; I’m letting the exact 200,000-walk measurement finish rather than substituting a cardinality argument for the required density sample.
diff --git a/gen_1912_00701.py b/gen_1912_00701.py
